    "detailed_description": "RAINETTE is a simple yet frustrating 3D platformer with a focus on smooth and tactile movement. Explore levels, set the best times, and get cool cosmetics! <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2450410/extras/1ed5d13c0e6bd8e1d8e674452339990f.avif?t=1732142591\" /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Movement</strong></h2>Set the best times with precise and momentum based movements.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2450410/extras/c16f38fbddc3e8aaf4e6c2dfe0c540d1.avif?t=1732142591\" /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cosmetics</strong></h2>Find hidden cosmetics in levels, or beat them to unlock colorful skins. All free.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Smooth movement:</strong> All the movement in RAINETTE is made to give the player unique controls.<br></li><li><strong>Free cosmetics:</strong> Every possible cosmetic in RAINETTE is freely attainable. Unlock all of them by playing and doing challenges.<br></li><li><strong>Fodian type gameplay:</strong> While RAINETTE may appear friendly, its gameplay is far from it. Move precisely and carefully if you want to beat the game!</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "RAINETTE is a simple yet frustrating 3D platformer with a focus on smooth and tactile movement. Explore levels, set the best times, and get cool cosmetics! <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2450410/extras/1ed5d13c0e6bd8e1d8e674452339990f.avif?t=1732142591\" /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Movement</strong></h2>Set the best times with precise and momentum based movements.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2450410/extras/c16f38fbddc3e8aaf4e6c2dfe0c540d1.avif?t=1732142591\" /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cosmetics</strong></h2>Find hidden cosmetics in levels, or beat them to unlock colorful skins. All free.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Smooth movement:</strong> All the movement in RAINETTE is made to give the player unique controls.<br></li><li><strong>Free cosmetics:</strong> Every possible cosmetic in RAINETTE is freely attainable. Unlock all of them by playing and doing challenges.<br></li><li><strong>Fodian type gameplay:</strong> While RAINETTE may appear friendly, its gameplay is far from it. Move precisely and carefully if you want to beat the game!</li></ul>",
